in: check
find: items_read = false;
replace:
caught-by:
    rules::layout::tests::the_index_waits_for_items_that_cannot_be_read

[break] outstanding-the-old-form-passes-its-first-line
rule: An item's first line is its sentence, never the table: a file in the form before the tenth tooling step is refused at line 1.
