replace: value.starts_with("cortex-")
caught-by:
    outstanding::tests::a_file_out_of_form_is_refused_at_its_line

[break] outstanding-a-flaky-test-named-twice
rule: An item names a flaky test once.
file: xtask/src/outstanding.rs
